            ["使用游戏原生规则检查一个真实物品是否符合当前客人的普通购买偏好及当前预算，并列出匹配的易货条件索引。只读，不移动或成交，不保证特殊委托已完成；价格是当前物品估值，放上柜台或谈价后可能变化。需要刚查询的客人 ID 和物品 ID，客人改变时会拒绝旧 ID。"] = "Read-only: use native rules to check one real item against the current customer's regular buying preferences and remaining budget, and list matching barter requirement indexes. Does not move items or complete a trade or special order. Current value is an estimate and may change at the counter or after negotiation. Requires freshly queried customer and item IDs; rejects an outdated customer ID.",
