            ["原始游戏标签/标识符。ALL_TYPE 表示通用购买，ALL_TYPE_EXCEPT_CONTRABAND 排除违禁品；状态、容器内容和自定义规则仍可能拒收。用 check_customer_item 核对具体物品；普通购买偏好不代表易货或委托条件。CustomerSellingDisabled 表示客人不向店主普通出售。"] = "Raw game tags/identifiers. ALL_TYPE means general buying; ALL_TYPE_EXCEPT_CONTRABAND excludes contraband. Item state, contents and custom rules can still cause rejection. Use check_customer_item for a specific item. Regular buying preferences are separate from barter and order requirements. CustomerSellingDisabled means this customer does not sell through regular trading.",
