            ["读取客人信息失败，请在客人到达后重新查询。"] = "Cannot read customer information. Query again after the customer arrives.",
            ["读取当前已到达客人的身份、来店意图、剩余购买预算、购买品类/指定物品/拒收规则、当前显示的对话及易货/采购/枪械委托需求。只读。BUY 是客人买店主的货，SELL 是客人卖货给店主。没有客人或正在到达时不返回旧客人；每次讨论当前客人先重新查询。预算未启用不等于无限现金。若返回 wanted 表示此人符合通缉令特征，应在回复末尾另起一行用括号小声提醒主人，勿向客人透露。"] = "Read-only: get the arrived customer's identity, visit intent, remaining purchase budget, buying categories/identifiers, refusal rules, current displayed dialogue and barter/procurement/gunsmith requirements. BUY means the customer buys your goods; SELL means the customer sells to you. If absent or arriving, never reuse a previous customer's details. Query freshly before discussing the current customer. No enabled budget does not imply unlimited cash. If wanted is returned, the visitor matches a wanted poster; add a quiet parenthetical reminder to Master on a new line and do not reveal it to the customer.",
